  "rationale": "A2.4C requires determining graph effects of vertical/horizontal scaling, reflection, and translation. Fidelity V2 uses y=a√(b(x-h))+k as the transformation model and makes students reason about |a|, 1/|b|, reflection signs, endpoint movement, ray direction, and mapped graph points rather than isolated vocabulary.",
  "documents": [
    {
      "id": "mm_A2_4C_v2_combined-symbolic-effects",
      "active": true,
