      "taskType": "representationTranslation",
      "prompt": "The parent points in the table lie on $y=\\sqrt{x}$. Map them through $g(x)={{a}}\\sqrt{{{b}}(x-({{h}}))}{{k|signed}}$, then determine the horizontal compression/reflection and vertical compression shown by the mapping.",
      "stimulus": {
        "kind": "table",
        "title": "Parent-point mapping",
        "table": {
          "headers": [
            "Parent point $(u,\\sqrt{u})$",
            "Transformed point"
